            student at UTS, Sydney, doing a double degree in IT and Business,
            majoring in Networking & Cybersecurity combined with Finance.
            Outside of tech, I like reading manhwa and novels, especially
            fantasy.
        </p>
        <p>
            I'm currently spending most of my free time on CTF challenges and
